# Feature — Budget Planner

## Overview
Users can set a spending limit per category per month.
Progress bar shows how much of the budget has been used.
Alert banner appears on Home when a budget is >= 80% used.
Notification triggered when budget reaches 100%.

## Budget Entity — budget.dart
```dart
import 'package:freezed_annotation/freezed_annotation.dart';
part 'budget.freezed.dart';

@freezed
class Budget with _$Budget {
  const factory Budget({
    required String id,
    required String categoryId,
    required int limitAmount,      // budget limit in IDR
    required int month,            // 1-12
    required int year,
    required DateTime createdAt,
  }) = _Budget;
}

// Budget Progress — computed, not stored
class BudgetProgress {
  final Budget budget;
  final int spentAmount;
  final int remainingAmount;
  final double percentage;         // 0.0 to 1.0+
  final bool isWarning;            // >= 80%
  final bool isExceeded;           // >= 100%

  BudgetProgress({
    required this.budget,
    required this.spentAmount,
  }) : remainingAmount = budget.limitAmount - spentAmount,
       percentage = spentAmount / budget.limitAmount,
       isWarning = spentAmount / budget.limitAmount >= 0.8,
       isExceeded = spentAmount >= budget.limitAmount;
}
```

