## Notification Rules
- Use flutter_local_notifications package
- Trigger when budget reaches exactly 80% → "⚠ [Category] budget is 80% used"
- Trigger when budget reaches 100% → "🚫 [Category] budget exceeded!"
- Only trigger once per threshold per month (store triggered state in Hive)

